  "fullText": "Publicación en el feed\n\nDiego Tarazona\n\n \n • 3er+\n\nTechnology Enthusiast, passionate about building business relationships | Marketing specialist | Project Management | Channel development Success\n\n10 meses\n\nSeguir\n\n🔥 What a Night to Remember! 🔥\n\n🎉 So much fun catching up with friends and partners, sharing laughs, and enjoying the amazing entertainment. Nights like these remind us why we love what we do!\n\n🙌 It was also incredible to see our whole team together, working side by side to keep building our role as the main partner distributor for Logitech. \n\nTeamwork really does make the dream work!\n\n👏 Huge thanks to everyone who made this event happen. Safe to say… we crushed it! 💪Nathan Klar, Elisa Corasaniti, Luke Heaslip, Matthew Tjoa, John Szemeczko, Jenny Xu, Jim Kapogianis, Matt Nowitsky, Vaughan Field, Wendy Cockburn, Maritza Marin, Georgina Zuliani, Bill Stokes, Maria Stella Villalobos\n\n#TDSYNNEX #LOGITECH#Teamwork #Partnership #Networking #BrandSuccess #WeCrushedIt #Gratitude #BusinessGrowth\n\nMostrar traducción\n\n1/7\n\n34\n2\n1\n​",
